  << /ActualText (Problem\072 Users struggled to maintain workout consistency and track physical progress\054 while training\054 nutrition and monitoring tools remained fragmented\056\n\nAction\072 Led the end\055to\055end UX\057UI process\054 from qualitative interviews and needs assessment to information architecture\054 user flows\054 prototyping and usability testing\056 Designed adaptive AI\055powered workouts\054 smartwatch integration\054 progress tracking\054 meal planning and gamification through a Health Score\056\n\nResult\072 Developed a high\055fidelity prototype integrating training\054 nutrition and fitness tracking\056 Conducted four usability tests to evaluate key flows and identify refinements before developer handoff\056)
